# Runtime config — may carry a hoosh bearer token. Commit the *.example files
# (no secrets); keep the real config local. 0.26.0: config lives at
# .thoth/config.cyml (discovered by walking up from CWD, then ~/.thoth);
# ./thoth.cyml is still read as a legacy fallback. .thoth/config.cyml.example
# and .thoth/memory/ stay tracked; only the real .thoth/config.cyml is ignored.
/.thoth/config.cyml
/thoth.cyml
# .thoth/checkpoints/ — the 0.40.0 file-snapshot store behind /rewind. Runtime state, per-machine and
# per-session, and it is written by the test suite too. Never tracked.
/.thoth/checkpoints/
